{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-09/1062807/block/singleImage/3262065/df/01M32NYWPD8D3PE1G65HEPK6S8.jpg?updatedAt=1794210977\"/><figcaption>據報阿里巴巴下半導體業務「平頭哥」計劃在明年赴港上市。(資料圖片/路透社)</figcaption></figure><p>據IFR引述消息報道，阿里巴巴（09988）旗下半導體業務「平頭哥」計劃在明年赴港上市，集資約20億美元至30億美元（約156億港元至235億港元）。 「平頭哥」半導體於2018年成立，主要負責數據中心領域半導體晶片業務，而公司名來自於蜜獾的別稱。阿里巴巴早前於雲棲大會上表示，預計「平頭哥」AI晶片出貨量將大幅提升，並發布最新晶片「真武V900」，號稱中國算力性能最強AI晶片，預計2027年首季量產。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.149412+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:56:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:11.358924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.747162+00:00","content_hash":"ee870d5948b6558783b3ebdb0f24ac842edcebfb14ad3e6def1c004c314e7e4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.149412+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}